WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.279 --> 00:00:13.140
gather some eggs," Chef said.

2
00:00:14.341 --> 00:00:16.062
He handed baskets to everyone.

3
00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.345
"We're making French toast today."

4
00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:23.147
"Yes!" Bobby cried.

5
00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:26.089
"I'm wearing my lucky shirt.

6
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.572
Whenever I wear it, something good happens.

7
00:00:31.472 --> 00:00:33.133
Once I hit a home run with it!"

8
00:00:38.556 --> 00:00:40.437
Nina put three eggs in her basket.

9
00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:42.959
"Thanks, chickens!"

10
00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:46.141
Bobby reached down to grab an egg.

11
00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:48.442
He heard a loud rip.

12
00:00:48.462 --> 00:00:51.264
"Oh, no!

13
00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:53.885
I just tore my good luck shirt."

14
00:00:53.905 --> 00:00:58.408
"That's bad luck," Jason said.

15
00:01:00.096 --> 00:01:03.818
"Bobby, your shirt is too small for you," Izzie said.

16
00:01:03.838 --> 00:01:05.959
"No wonder it ripped."

17
00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.501
Bobby shrugged.

18
00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:11.682
"I bet my mom can sew it."

19
00:01:14.604 --> 00:01:16.585
The kids carried the eggs into the kitchen.

20
00:01:18.486 --> 00:01:19.847
Everyone looked at the recipe.

21
00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:25.050
"We need four eggs for French toast," Izzie said.

22
00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:28.311
"Remember to crack them properly!"

23
00:01:28.732 --> 00:01:29.332
Chef said.

24
00:01:31.604 --> 00:01:33.986
Each kid cracked an egg into a shallow dish.

25
00:01:36.108 --> 00:01:37.209
Jason added milk.

26
00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.052
Then Bobby whisked the mixture.

27
00:01:40.072 --> 00:01:44.436
"Chef, does French toast come from France?"

28
00:01:44.956 --> 00:01:45.777
Nina asked.

29
00:01:47.658 --> 00:01:52.062
"No, people first made this dish in ancient Rome," Chef said.

30
00:01:52.082 --> 00:01:56.246
"I heard that a man named French made it popular in America.

31
00:01:57.147 --> 00:01:58.348
But I'm not sure it's true.

32
00:01:59.468 --> 00:02:02.189
Today people all over the world eat fried egg bread."

33
00:02:03.629 --> 00:02:04.449
Bobby grinned.

34
00:02:04.469 --> 00:02:08.410
"I want lots of maple syrup on mine!"

35
00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:13.152
"We'll try different toppings today," Chef said.

36
00:02:13.172 --> 00:02:15.272
"Like what?"

37
00:02:15.672 --> 00:02:16.653
Jason asked.

38
00:02:17.953 --> 00:02:20.814
Chef pointed to some ingredients on the counter.

39
00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:25.335
Bobby saw ketchup, cheese, peanut butter, and yogurt.

40
00:02:25.355 --> 00:02:28.476
"Ugh," Bobby thought.

41
00:02:29.508 --> 00:02:32.210
"This isn't my lucky day after all."

42
00:02:33.311 --> 00:02:35.113
He didn't want any of those toppings.

43
00:02:36.854 --> 00:02:38.836
Chef melted butter in a frying pan.

44
00:02:38.856 --> 00:02:43.419
"Now let's dip a slice of bread in the egg mixture.

45
00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.803
We're using stale bread because it soaks up the egg nicely."

46
00:02:49.785 --> 00:02:52.127
Izzie dipped a slice of bread in the egg mixture.

47
00:02:53.247 --> 00:02:54.368
She turned it over.

48
00:02:54.388 --> 00:02:58.512
"There! I coated both sides.

49
00:02:59.656 --> 00:03:01.258
It's ready for the frying pan!"

50
00:03:03.279 --> 00:03:06.282
The other kids each took a turn dipping bread slices.

51
00:03:08.244 --> 00:03:10.846
Soon four slices were frying in the pan.

52
00:03:12.547 --> 00:03:16.110
After a few minutes, Chef lifted the corner of each bread slice.

53
00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.733
"They're golden brown.

54
00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:20.794
Let's flip them over."

55
00:03:20.814 --> 00:03:24.277
"I'll do it," Jason said.

56
00:03:24.297 --> 00:03:27.040
"I'll help," Nina said.

57
00:03:28.768 --> 00:03:31.710
When the French toast was ready, Chef put it on plates.

58
00:03:35.953 --> 00:03:36.754
choose your topping."

59
00:03:38.915 --> 00:03:40.777
Izzie spread yogurt on her slice.

60
00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:51.524
"I'm going to try mine with cheese," Nina said.

61
00:03:51.544 --> 00:03:56.648
"Ketchup sounds weird, but I'll try it," Jason said.

62
00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.942
"That's how they eat it in England," Chef said.

63
00:04:02.663 --> 00:04:03.964
Bobby crossed his arms.

64
00:04:03.984 --> 00:04:07.466
"I only like French toast with syrup."

65
00:04:08.907 --> 00:04:10.248
Chef lifted an eyebrow.

66
00:04:10.268 --> 00:04:13.310
"Part of cooking is trying new dishes."

67
00:04:15.151 --> 00:04:17.133
Bobby frowned, watching his friends eat.

68
00:04:17.153 --> 00:04:20.555
"I like things to stay the same."

69
00:04:21.756 --> 00:04:23.957
Finally he couldn't stand it anymore.

70
00:04:23.977 --> 00:04:26.539
"I'll try peanut butter."

71
00:04:28.236 --> 00:04:29.777
"Great," Chef said.

72
00:04:32.799 --> 00:04:34.681
The warm bread melted the peanut butter.

73
00:04:36.722 --> 00:04:37.803
Bobby took a taste.

74
00:04:37.823 --> 00:04:40.264
"It's pretty good!"

75
00:04:42.226 --> 00:04:43.066
Chef smiled.

76
00:04:43.086 --> 00:04:45.788
"See, change can be good."

77
00:04:48.891 --> 00:04:51.032
Later the kids walked outside together.

78
00:04:51.052 --> 00:04:56.456
"My lucky shirt really is too small," Bobby said.

79
00:04:57.376 --> 00:04:58.777
"Time for a new one."

80
00:04:58.797 --> 00:05:01.958
"Just don't spill peanut butter on it!"

81
00:05:02.379 --> 00:05:03.259
Jason said.

82
00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.180
Bobby laughed.

83
00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.322
"That would be unlucky for sure!"
